' ============================================================================
' METADATA
'   author:       TheRobotDrafts Examples
'   description:  Small UAF/UPDM Operational viewpoint on a grid (row x col).
'   usecase:      Teach grid addressing and viewpoints for defense architecture.
'   complexity:   simple
'   domain:       enterprise / defense-architecture
' ============================================================================
title Example UAF/UPDM - Simple Operational Viewpoint

' UAF organizes the architecture on a GRID of viewpoints (rows) x aspects (cols).
' Rows: Strategic, Operational, Systems, Services, Standards, etc.
' Cols: Personnel, OperationalActivities, Resources, Information, etc.
' Below, a 3x3 grid is shown by nested packages (a TRD grid addressing aid).

note as TopNote
  UAF/UPDM grid:
  Rows = viewpoints (Operational shown here)
  Cols = aspects (OperationalActivities, Resources, Information)
  Each cell holds a model element addressed by (row, col).
end note

package "Operational Row x OperationalActivities Col" as O_OA {
  usecase "Conduct Surveillance" as UC1
}

package "Operational Row x Resources Col" as O_R {
  actor "Sensor Operator" as A1
}

package "Operational Row x Information Col" as O_I {
  rectangle "Track Report" as T1
}

' Needline = operational info flow between nodes, addressed across grid cells.
A1 --> UC1 : performs (needline)
UC1 --> T1 : produces (info)
T1 --> A1 : consumed (info)
